 things  you must perform a perfect parry with  deruk's protection by releasing zl right  as a bomb detonates and at the exact  time step up onto a small ledge if done  correctly link will take to the skies  with style  kibako launch by placing a bomb and link  on opposite ends of the box detonating  it will send link flying through the air  instead of just falling to the ground  this can be only performed with wooden  boxes though metal ones won't work in  this case  ladder launch  these ladder towers can be destroyed  with a bomb so by jumping onto them as  they are destroyed climbing it will  immediately shoot you to the top doing a  hold smuggle which is another glitch  forcing you to hold an item while this  is happening will shoot you skyward  instead  by placing a horse downhill with his  rear legs up then shield jumping in  place as you mount the horse on the  backside will set up for the beginning  of the glitch then go for a small ride  in the forward direction dismounting  will then cause link to fly backwards at  high speeds and go for a nice flight  sliding same concept as horse sliding  but using a tree instead between the  master cycles tires will also set up the  same trick again go for a quick ride  forward then dismount for a quick zip  backwards  octo balloon snap launch using a glitch  to attach a octo balloon to an object to  yourself stasising the balloon then  putting yourself between a heavy object  it will aggressively snap back to you  after stasis and launch the item you're  on and you along with it  [Music]  moon jumping while not the fastest  method of travel it is one of the most  versatile allowing link to jump to any  height at any time with no stamina or  health needed mounting a wild horse but  not taming it during the mounted archery  mini game then warping away allows you  to jump to the heavens  super soul launch  moon jump also sets up for some other  lesser-known ways to travel by mounting  the lynel and osira planes instead of a  horse then separating your camera from  link then ancient arrowing the lynel  pulling out your paraglider will cause  link's soul to snap back into his body  and send him greening into the distance  slipping over almost every obstacle in  the way definitely one of the tougher  ones to perform  another trick only available while in  the moon jump state flying chest  requires some very specific footwork by  having one foot slightly over the edge  of the chest magnesius in the chest will  lift link upwards and ascend him to the  skies  this reminds me of another similar trick  flying machine cart version flying  machine is one of the oldest ways to  travel across hyrule magnesius seeing  the lower mine cart sandwiches the upper  mine cart between you and link taking  you skyward  flying machine box version this can also  be performed with a metal box but  unfortunately this version can be a  little more  wobbly  death mountain shield block reset  possibly the most inefficient way to get  height this combines shrine apparatus  storage 2.0 and drowning lava bow  smuggling then shield block resetting  with a strong shield over and over to  climb the stairway to heaven with flashy  style just don't expect to last too  long momentum transfer there are several  variations of this technique but the  most standard case is to use it after  any ragdolling launch which you then  watch a memory then load a file you'll  load back in but already flying skyward  horse momentum transfer this is the same  process but without needing to watch a  memory instead loading immediately after  being hit by a stasis object loading  back in on a saved horse will allow you  to dismount wherever you'd like and  rocket skywars  bullet time bounce  one of the most famous ways to navigate  the world bullet time bounces allow link  to gain massive speed and air time by  shield surfing onto a low level headshot  or frozen enemy in bullet time hitting  them will cause lane to fly off into the  sunset this can include bigger enemies  such as the henox and its eye  mulduga or talus bounce many attacks  including the mulduga's tail whips and  the talus punches can be a nice  launching platform for a quick  commercial flight across the land by  shield jumping just as the attack  strikes you link will bounce off and go  flying across hyrule  henoc's arm launch taking to the skies  for the master cycle is pretty easy with  the helping hand of a henox literally  jumping onto its hand spooks it to get  up quickly knocking you and the bike  upward for some decent air time  master cycle cryonis launch entering  bullet time then mounting the bike  quickly just as the cryoness block lifts  it sends link skyward for a massive  skyward boost  stasis bounce while it looks similar to  stasis launching it's much different  since you're in the shield surf  animation instead lining yourself up to  a metal box then shield surf jumping  just as the box strikes you causes you  to get a massive launch similar to  bullet time bounces  [Music]  cryonus bounce by using a waterfall's  vertical angle and spawning a crown is  blocked sideways it can be used as a  horizontal launch pad to jet across the  world quickly sometimes you can even go  so fast to skim across a surface of  ground or water just like skipping a  rock on a pond  bomb launch a technique that most casual  players get confused with wind bombs  bomb launching uses both remote bombs  placed on the ground in a specific order  with bullet time landing between the  bombs sideways and bullet time pushes  link out aggressively and sends him  flying off into the distance this is  much more difficult than it looks  wind bomb you've probably been waiting  for this one  the basic front hop or backflip wind  bomb is the most standard way that  everybody knows by detonating the  farthest bomb and pushing the closer  bomb into link the impact rockets link  up up and away  bullet time wind bombs this combines any  glitch or technique that forces bullet  time on open ground such as shield lock  presets jelly bouncing and shield jump  cancels to get wind bombs off of  completely flat ground certainly is more  for the style points and can be tricky  to pull off  midair or linear wind bombs  neutral gliding in place then dropping  the bombs or lining them up both at  bullet time and full speeds allows you  to get a wind bomb mid-air these of  course can be chained together to get  tons of height and distance over time  vertical wind bombs these wind bombs go  almost straight up sacrificing distance  for verticality placing the bomb in  front of a curb then back flipping  quickly over it you can sandwich the  bombs between each other like a pillar  allowing for a launch straight up  spider-wind bombs pretty standard wind  bombs but maybe a little peter parker  energy thrown in the mix by jumping off  a climbable wall first gotta say it's  pretty stylish  bomb arrow wind bumps while it's not  particularly efficient bomb arrows can  substitute as a remote bomb as well  launching link just like any normal wind  bomb would  blss the newest addition to the bunch  blss uses several glitches together to  hover and fly across hyrule with ease  using no stamina or health there are  multiple variations and movement types  blss offers by holding different items  or even different stances such as when  link has zero arrows we got a video all  about this on our channel  and that's it there are many other small  variations of launch techniques here and  there but these are the most unique and  well-known ones if you like this video  or want us to explain some of these more  in depth let us know in the comments  below and of course for everything else  gaming stay tuned right here on gamespot  [Music]  you

